{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>יַהֲפֹ֥ךְ יָד֖וֹ.</b> The commentator who interprets <b>בעברתו</b> as referring to HaShem will interpret יהפך ידו as His hand of smiting, as in 'the hand of YHWH is upon' your livestock (Exodus 9:3), and 'the one who strikes with the hand.'"], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The verse reference is cited by its distinctive phrase rather than full quotation; resolved to Exodus 9:3 based on the words הנה יד ה' הויה במקנך."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:38.184918643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}